{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>The house of the righteous</b> — the meaning is like <b>the house of wealth</b>, a storehouse of grain. And the Aramaic translation of ממגורות is חסניא, as in: לא יחסן. The meaning: in the house of the righteous is a great storehouse, full of grain." "<b>But the produce of the wicked is troubled</b> — there is grain that is troubled, as when one plants wheat and gets thorns, and so forth."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {0 "Resolved תרגום as 'the Aramaic translation'; the verse cited as לא יחסן is likely Isaiah 23:18 or similar, left untranslated as Ibn Ezra quotes only the Hebrew."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:58.419788625Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}